SUMMARY:Klidonas bonfires\, Chroussa
LOCATION:Chroussa\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The village of Chroussa in the south of Syros revives the Klidonas on the night of 23-24 June at the old Faneromeni primary school: the May wreaths are burned\, kids jump the fire\, and the association serves meze and wine with live music. Small and local\; 20 minutes by car from Ermoupoli.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#chroussa-klidonas-bonfires-chroussa
